    "en": {
      "title": "Weber",
      "h1": "Weber",
      "description": "Weber is a leading manufacturer of mineral-based construction products and system solutions for new build and renovation. As part of the Saint-Gobain group…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Weber",
          "width": 1100,
          "height": 839,
          "src": "/assets/img/weber-1.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Weber is a leading manufacturer of mineral-based construction products and system solutions for new build and renovation. As part of the Saint-Gobain group, Weber offers a comprehensive range in areas such as façades, plaster, masonry mortar, floor levelling, concrete and tiling. The company develops and manufactures products such as LECA blocks, lightweight clinker, façade rendering, concrete and masonry mortar, adapted to the Swedish market."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "By offering products and systems that contribute to energy efficiency and reduced environmental impact, Weber positions itself as a reliable partner for contractors, construction companies and architects throughout Sweden."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Take a look at their website or <a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">contact us</a> for more information."
